ion decoupled from ingestion.\n\n**How to apply:** The book path is standalone: `node scripts/longview/longview.mjs reduce --only dossiers,themes,report` → `opus` → `pdf` (no ingest needed; retrieval reads existing vectors/graph). Never run deep-synthesis ingest concurrently with LLM reduce/opus phases on the same lemonade box. v1.10.1 not yet cut as of 2026-07-03 morning — commits are local; release needs manage-release.js + push main before tag. Code phase cp1252/braille UnicodeEncodeError still unfixed despite PYTHONIOENCODING env (crashes benny enrich child); weave discovery-questions JSON parse also failed twice that night.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":16,"oldLines":4,"newStart":16,"newLines":4,"lines":[" "," **Why:** every coupling here was \"one slow/failing stage silently poisons or kills everything downstream\" — the user explicitly wants the book (opus) generation decoupled from ingestion."," ","-**How to apply:** The book path is standalone: `node scripts/longview/longview.mjs reduce --only dossiers,themes,report` → `opus` → `pdf` (no ingest needed; retrieval reads existing vectors/graph). Never run deep-synthesis ingest concurrently with LLM reduce/opus phases on the same lemonade box. v1.10.1 not yet cut as of 2026-07-03 morning — commits are local; release needs manage-release.js + push main before tag. Code phase cp1252/braille UnicodeEncodeError still unfixed despite PYTHONIOENCODING env (crashes benny enrich child); weave discovery-questions JSON parse also failed twice that night.","+**How to apply:** The book path is standalone: `node scripts/longview/longview.mjs reduce --only dossiers,themes,report` → `opus` → `pdf` (no ingest needed; retrieval reads existing vectors/graph). Never run deep-synthesis ingest concurrently with LLM reduce/opus phases on the same lemonade box. v1.10.1 CUT + PUSHED 2026-07-03 (~07:06 UTC): docs updated (LONGVIEW_GUIDE \"Book on demand\" + troubleshooting, scripts/longview/README 9-phase table, CLAUDE.md status), 