t-try: 4 parts / 14 chapters / 72 sections planned. v1.10.2 cut + pushed 2026-07-03 ~08:44 UTC with these three commits.\n\n**How to apply:** The book path is standalone: `node scripts/longview/longview.mjs reduce --only dossiers,themes,report` → `opus` → `pdf` (no ingest needed; retrieval reads existing vectors/graph). Never run deep-synthesis ingest concurrently with LLM reduce/opus phases on the same lemonade box. v1.10.1 CUT + PUSHED 2026-07-03 (~07:06 UTC): docs updated (LONGVIEW_GUIDE \"Book on demand\" + troubleshooting, scripts/longview/README 9-phase table, CLAUDE.md status), main pushed before tag, Release Desktop workflow triggered. Still open: code phase cp1252/braille UnicodeEncodeError despite PYTHONIOENCODING env (crashes benny enrich child); weave discovery-questions JSON parse failed twice that night; 32 card docs still marked un-ingested (next full run re-attempts the ~4h deep-synthesis pass).\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":6,"newStart":1,"newLines":6,"lines":[" ---"," name: longview-book-decoupling-fixes","-description: \"Why the AI Vampire book never generated (2026-07-03 run), the four decoupling fixes, and the kg3d stack-overflow fix shipped for v1.10.1\"","+description: \"Why the AI Vampire book never generated (2026-07-03 run), the decoupling + JSON-mode fixes shipped in v1.10.1/v1.10.2, and the kg3d stack-overflow fix\""," metadata: ","   node_type: memory","   type: project"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"53b3ca26-1ed4-4c11-b40c-7210287bf4d6","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\nsdha\\OneDrive\\binary16\\prime-silo","sessionId":"7aba7344-6e98-4c00-b7e9-ad132cfe087b","version":"2.1.197","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
