ocs/ADR-001](docs/ADR-001-storage-engine.md) | Storage engine: rocksdict/RocksDB + BlobDB, wire format, single-writer rule |\n| [docs/ADR-002](docs/ADR-002-vector-index.md) | 1-bit quantization, USearch/brute backends, determinism, measured recall curves, candidate floor |\n| [docs/ADR-003](docs/ADR-003-primesilo-swap-seam.md) | Chroma-compat surface, `PRIME_SILO_KNOWLEDGE_STORE=s16` toggle, gates G0–G3 |\n| [docs/PLAN.md](docs/PLAN.md) | Solution planner & tracker (phases P0–P5, risk register) |\n\n## Quickstart\n\n```powershell\npy -3.14 -m venv .venv\n.venv\\Scripts\\python -m pip install -e .[dev]\n.venv\\Scripts\\python -m pytest          # 49 tests, coverage gate >= 80% (currently ~99%)\n.venv\\Scripts\\python bench\\bench_feasibility.py   # honest numbers -> bench/results.json\n```\n\n```python\nfrom s16 import S16KnowledgeStore\n\nstore = S16KnowledgeStore(\"./mystore\", ndim=768)\nstore.put(1, embedding, b\"payload bytes\", {\"source\": \"doc.md\"})\nhits = store.search(query_embedding, k=10)   # [(key, cosine_score), ...]\npayload, metadata = store.get(hits[0][0])\nstore.persist()\n```\n\nChroma-shaped bridge (the future Prime-Silo seam — see ADR-003):\n\n```python\nfrom s16.toggle import resolve_collection\ncol = resolve_collection(persist_dir, \"knowledge\")   # None unless PRIME_SILO_KNOWLEDGE_STORE=s16\n```\n\n## Measured (bench/results.json, 10k docs × 768 dims, Windows/cp314)\n\n| Backend | Ingest | Search p50 | Recall@10 | Disk (kv + index) |\n| ------- | ------ | ---------- | --------- | ----------------- |\n| brute (exact) | ~35k docs/s | ~5.6 ms | 1.00 | 30.3 MB + 1.0 MB |\n| usearch (HNSW) | ~9k docs/s | ~4.1 ms | 1.00 | 30.3 MB + 2.3 MB |\n\nNumbers regenerate with the bench script; no number lives only in prose.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":6,"oldLines":9,"newStart":6,"newLines":11,"lines":[" reference backend) with **float32 cosine rescore**. No server, no JRE, no"," network — one directory on disk."," ","-**Status:** feasibility proven 